    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all you have is a Forklift, everything looks like palete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a flight to\u00a0<strong>Ghibli</strong> stylized <strong>JAPAN</strong>!<br>Let your forklift loose on a peacefull prefecture. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through whole island and solve more than 30 puzzles to learn your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truck takes your parking place? No problem, you can forklift them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Kei Cars on the right parking spots, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can have alarms, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And might be Wired,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be smart about parking gates,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use illegal moves when no one sees,\u00a0<br><br>But sometimes you can Help others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they will show you how to cook Ramen?\u00a0 Of course using a forklift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elegant forklift straight from Japan (that's you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of kei cars to stick on the fork,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated beep button (!!!)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When all you have is a Forklift, everything looks like palete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a flight to\u00a0<strong>Ghibli</strong> stylized <strong>JAPAN</strong>!<br>Let your forklift loose on a peacefull prefecture. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through whole island and solve more than 30 puzzles to learn your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truck takes your parking place? No problem, you can forklift them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place Kei Cars on the right parking spots, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can have alarms, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And might be Wired,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be smart about parking gates,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use illegal moves when no one sees,\u00a0<br><br>But sometimes you can Help others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe they will show you how to cook Ramen?\u00a0 Of course using a forklift!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elegant forklift straight from Japan (that's you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of kei cars to stick on the fork,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated beep button (!!!)</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Silly, physics-based forklift game inspired by Ghibli and Japan car culture! Use your forklift skills in logic puzzles with many unexpected outcomes!",
